  "entry": "code/index.html",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Turns the raw chemiluminescence exposures and white-light marker photos from one western blot experiment into a labelled figure with molecular-weight ticks, ready for publication, plus densitometry and a processing log. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
